{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dystopian narrative management game, you are placed in charge of a struggling street under a cold and authoritarian Party. Each day, you go to work, hear pleas from residents and demands from Party officials, and decide whether to protect the street\u2019s health or secure your own comfort through corruption and wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780480/extras/4bb44634c548fe41aa5712d37b75f2c2.poster.avif?t=1770444751\" width=586 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780480/extras/4bb44634c548fe41aa5712d37b75f2c2.webm?t=1770444751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780480/extras/4bb44634c548fe41aa5712d37b75f2c2.mp4?t=1770444751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Key features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hear requests from civilians and Party officials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Choose between helping the street or serving the Party</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Collect taxes and grow your personal wealth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Repair and improve the street</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Upgrade your home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Join the resistance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Approve Party propaganda</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780480/extras/f4aea1dcc464e6deed170564e2eef212.poster.avif?t=1770444751\" width=586 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780480/extras/f4aea1dcc464e6deed170564e2eef212.webm?t=1770444751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780480/extras/f4aea1dcc464e6deed170564e2eef212.mp4?t=1770444751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Lore</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DAC are the ruling Party, having secured the loyalty of the upper and middle classes, It's time to bring the working class into line. They appoint you - Edmund, a fellow working class man -as Street Overseer, trusting a familiar face will help to enforce order while living among the people he controls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780480/extras/cd526a81abead1b9d6f4a0db4f318200.poster.avif?t=1770444751\" width=586 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780480/extras/cd526a81abead1b9d6f4a0db4f318200.webm?t=1770444751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780480/extras/cd526a81abead1b9d6f4a0db4f318200.mp4?t=1770444751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2780480?t=1770444751","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2780480?t=1770444751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780480/2f5023bb4e768f4bea4dc80c56d3ceafd009e09b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770444751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a